# Challenges: Flawless Edge (no misses allowed) ends on the first throw,
# struck into a blade (`node tools/plan.mjs challenge-flawless-edge --miss 1`),
# then Ember Sprint's 60-second limit runs out with no throw: Time Expired.
until 300 Play
frames 5
click Play
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 5
click Challenges
until 60 Flawless Edge
frames 5
click Flawless Edge
until 60 Begin
frames 5
click Begin
frames 344
key Space 2
until 200 Out of Misses
expect Retry
frames 5
save flawless
key Escape 2
until 60 Play
frames 5
click Play
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 5
click Challenges
until 60 Ember Sprint
frames 5
click Ember Sprint
until 60 Begin
expect 60s limit
frames 5
click Begin
frames 300
expect TIME
save sprint
until 3700 Time Expired
